WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:24.000
Mysterious Challenger
Giant Moving Fortress Surfaces!

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:39.870
Did Marik really get rid of Bakura in last night's Shadow Game?

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:42.880
Yugi, you were here?

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:45.340
Where's Bakura?

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.880
I don't know.

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:52.890
I don't care where losers go after they lose a Shadow Game.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.800
The guy pretending to be Marik...

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:08.970
And Mai...  Marik is responsible for both.

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:16.660
I don't know how he's related to my other self's memories, but I can't forgive Marik!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.280
Ouch!

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.280
What was that?

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.220
An earthquake?

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.820
I'm on an airship, so it couldn't be a quake.

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:32.920
Shizuka...

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.590
Shizuka...

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:38.000
What are you both dreaming about!

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.030
Wake up!

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.220
What's up?

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.270
Morning already?

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:46.940
Wake up!  Something's wrong with the ship!

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:54.820
Huh?

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:58.750
Anzu?

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.560
Since when-

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.220
What's happening?

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:12.100
What are you doing?

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.820
Stabilize the ship!

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.000
What's going on?

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:20.400
Big brother!  The Battle Ship is going off course!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.310
What?

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.660
Fix the trajectory!

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:27.740
The autopilot is acting on its own!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.400
Say what?

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.620
Switch to manual-

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:31.420
Kaiba!

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.660
Why is the ship shaking?

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.350
Is this ship safe?

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:45.800
I sense an evil presence.

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:49.560
I think something interesting will happen.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:56.050
What are you doing?

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:58.500
I can't switch to manual mode!

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.820
It's out of control!

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:00.400
What?

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:03.650
Access to Alcatraz's computer denied!

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.000
No guide signals!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.450
Impossible!

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.120
What's that island?

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:12.060
That's our final destination, Alcatraz.

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:14.880
That's the final venue?

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:16.120
That's right.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:23.430
That debris represents the corpse of Gozaburo Kaiba, founder of Kaiba Corporation.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:32.980
Our foster father, Gozaburo Kaiba, was a huge defense contractor who wanted to conquer the world.

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:36.580
That man-made island is what's left of his dreams.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:41.820
When he died, my brother transformed Kaiba Corporation into a game business.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:47.300
He destroyed the military factories and built the Duel Tower on that site.

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:49.700
That's enough, Mokuba.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:55.400
I built the Duel Tower on Alcatraz among the debris.

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:58.170
It symbolizes my determination.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:05.510
When I get the title of Duel King on top of that tower, I will become the true victor!

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:09.110
And overcome the grudge I have against him!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:15.800
Kaiba resents his dad?

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:18.370
What happened between them?

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.400
I found the cause!

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:33.480
Someone is illegally accessing our computer!

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:37.500
He broke into our controls and is steering our ship!

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.140
Get rid of the intruder!

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:42.780
Land on Alcatraz, as we planned!

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:51.020
Who would do this?

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.440
What's going on?

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.430
Trying to kill us?

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:04.040
Do something, Kaiba!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.560
Can't you get the controls back?

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:09.370
No!  We've been completely taken over!

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:11.350
Impossible!

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:13.240
Is this Gozaburo's ghost?

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:17.210
Is he stopping us from getting to the island?

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.600
Who are you?

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.240
This kid...  It can't be...

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.400
I was waiting for you, Seto.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:40.840
Welcome, duelists.

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:43.560
A kid?

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:46.100
He called Kaiba by his first name.

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:49.640
He must know Kaiba well.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:54.320
He looks exactly like my brother when he was younger.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:55.580
Answer me!

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.250
Who are you?

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:59.140
My name is Noa.

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:05.190
Basically, I have greatly surpassed you, Seto.

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:07.860
Such nonsense!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:12.700
I'm inviting you to come to me.

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:16.740
What's Noa planning?

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:24.880
What's that?

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:29.420
What?

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:30.320
That's...

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.450
What?

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.170
No way.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.600
It's huge!

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.040
It's monstrous.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:10.830
I don't know what's going on, but it's getting interesting.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.370
Do something!

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:14.570
No good!  We've lost control!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.500
We're caught!

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.580
Damn!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.530
What's going to happen?

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.040
Brother...

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:21.720
Don't worry.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.470
I-I'll protect you!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.410
How dare you!

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:33.580
Could a kid like Noa do all this?

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.150
Not likely...

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:49.600
Please disembark.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:52.130
Including the other duelists.

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:54.800
What if I say no?

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:57.770
You're already in my hands.

00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:59.370
You have no choice.

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:04.530
Hey!

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:05.720
Is this for real?

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.190
Kaiba!

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:13.880
He's after me.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.620
It's none of your business.

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:16.460
But...

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.420
Mokuba, stay here.

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:21.230
But brother!

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:24.680
Noa, what do you want?

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.050
Tell me!

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:38.750
I said "including the other duelists."

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:47.560
Let's do what he says for now.

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:50.560
Kaiba, this doesn't only concern you.

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:54.110
He's not letting us leave either.

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:00.690
Seto!

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:05.370
I don't need more people.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:07.480
You stay on the ship.

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.340
What does he mean?

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:12.010
I guess we're duelists too.

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:18.260
Shizuka, stay on the ship.

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:22.400
I can't let you face danger alone!

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:24.630
Shizuka!

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:33.070
This place reeks of destruction and chaos.

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:36.870
I'll just stay back and observe.

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:41.410
What will you do to us?

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:47.350
There are people longing to see you.

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:51.700
They'll explain the situation.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:01.340
What's this room?

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:03.640
It's huge and empty.

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:05.570
If someone's here, come out!

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:08.540
What is it?

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:17.710
Seto Kaiba and friends, it's been a while.

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:20.280
No way!  You're...

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:36.360
No way!  You're...

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:38.030
The Big Five!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.620
What?  The Big Five?

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.970
You know who they are?

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:47.640
They're Kaiba Corporation executives who betrayed Kaiba.

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:52.200
They used dirty tricks to try to take over my brother's company.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:58.860
But weren't they trapped in cyberspace after losing at their own game?

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:04.130
President, let's play a game with our jobs on the line.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:08.180
You're not worthy of being President.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:11.650
We'll destroy you and your Blue-Eyes.

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:14.400
Big brother!

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:24.380
I'll make you pay, The Big Five!

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.960
Go, Dragon Master Knight!

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:40.340
Galaxy Crusher!

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.540
Impossible!

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:55.710
We returned to the real world, but they remained unconscious.

00:13:56.140 --> 00:14:00.310
Since then, we've been wandering cyberspace.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:04.980
We almost forgot who we were.

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:09.190
If not for our determination to get our revenge against you.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:14.130
We don't only want to get revenge against you, Seto Kaiba.

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:21.570
Yugi Muto and his friends also made us suffer, so they're guilty too.

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:23.910
That doesn't make sense!

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:26.000
You don't know when to give up.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.000
How did you resurrect?

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:35.180
While wandering cyberspace, someone learned of our grudge and helped us.

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:38.620
That Noa kid.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:41.840
He made us an offer.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:50.560
For The Big Five to control Kaiba Corporation again, we must defeat you in a fair duel.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.570
Duel us?

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:58.010
We'd love to get rid of you quickly, but we must obey Noa's wishes.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:03.940
If you want to leave, you must defeat us in a duel.

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:07.250
We'll never lose against you in a duel!

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:12.300
We invite you to our duel world.

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.340
Where are we?

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:36.880
A jungle?

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:40.410
It's a virtual world.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.240
Brother!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.000
It's fine.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:49.890
No matter how real it looks, they're simply images.

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:56.570
But it's more than colors and shapes.  It smells real too.

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:01.110
I can even feel the air.

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:06.840
Brother!

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.880
L-Like I said, it's only an image.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:15.760
Kaiba!

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:16.780
Big brother!

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:28.860
You think you can scare me when you can't recreate the sense of touch?

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:33.800
It's a poor copy of my Solid Vision.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.740
You're right.

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:52.820
What joke is this?

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:09.440
Who's that?

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:14.240
We'll duel using the Deck Master System.

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.180
Deck Master System?

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:22.040
We'll show you a demo duel so that you can understand the system.

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:26.040
Total Defense Shogun will be his own Deck Master.

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:31.790
Seto Kaiba's Deck Master will be Blue-Eyes White Dragon.

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:34.180
Blue-Eyes is the Deck Master?

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.730
What are the rules?

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:39.430
My turn!  I summon Lord of D.!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:48.610
I activate the spell card The Flute of Summoning Dragon!

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:58.940
Its effect lets me summon two Dragons from my hand!

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.820
I also summon my Deck Master to my field!

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:12.720
He already has three Blue-Eyes on his field!

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:18.370
I see!  Summoning your Deck Master counts separately than your Normal Summon!

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:24.440
I Fusion Summon Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:48.450
Due to his Deck Master's ability, when Ultimate Dragon is Fusion Summoned...

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.970
...it can attack that turn.

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:56.940
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon, attack Total Defense Shogun directly!

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:09.550
Total Defense Shogun is his own Deck Master.

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:14.260
He can pay 1000 life points to activate his Deck Master's ability.

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:16.440
Total Defense Barrier!

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:27.840
Due to Total Defense Barrier's effect, the attacking monster is destroyed.

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:36.720
When your Deck Master is destroyed, you lose.  Even if you still have life points.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:41.770
Deck Masters have unique abilities.

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:47.910
Choosing which monster to be your Deck Master will be very critical.

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:50.200
Such nonsense!

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:55.370
You say we'll have a fair duel, but you're forcing us to play by these lame rules!

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:58.900
The Big Five, you'll pay!

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:13.350
Well?  Will you duel us?

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:19.460
Accepting our challenge is the only way to escape.

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:23.260
Damn!  That means we have no choice!

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:26.510
Fine!  I accept!

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:27.570
Brother...

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:30.240
Don't worry, Shizuka.

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:32.740
As a duelist, I promise to win!

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:36.140
And I promise to protect you.

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.680
Do your best, brother!

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:39.820
Yeah!

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.040
We have no choice but to duel.

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:45.480
I'll duel too!

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:46.220
Me too!

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:49.260
All right!  Let's do it!

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:50.650
Wait a sec!

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:53.690
What happens if we lose?

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:57.360
Good question.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:02.900
Just as there's a reward for winning, there's a price for losing.

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:12.080
If you lose, our spirits in this cyber world will take over your physical bodies.

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:14.450
You...!

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:21.620
We'll switch places, and you'll wander through cyberspace for eternity!

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:22.800
No way!

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:23.700
Damn!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:24.620
That's not fair!

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:31.010
This is our revenge!

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:49.060
The Big Five challenge us to a duel.

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:53.600
We have no choice but to fight if we want to escape!

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:55.940
We become separated in the virtual world.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:59.570
Deepsea Warrior appears before Yugi.

00:21:59.570 --> 00:22:05.250
The Deck Master System lets The Big Five transform into monsters!

00:22:05.460 --> 00:22:08.650
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Deck Master Deepsea Warrior

00:22:08.650 --> 00:22:10.140
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:21.630
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:30.570
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.900 --> 00:22:35.540
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:39.510
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:47.480
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.480 --> 00:22:51.050
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:55.820
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.820 --> 00:23:05.930
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.930 --> 00:23:13.540
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.770 --> 00:23:22.510
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.510 --> 00:23:30.490
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:30.490 --> 00:23:40.330
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
